      "status": "resolved",
      "source": "stage-queries.ts:154; stage-actions.ts:159; stage-panel.tsx:301; api/client.ts:5328; api/schemas.ts:3868; server/internal/handler/workspace.go:498",
      "evidence": "The existing explicit-workspace member query supplies real workspace_id/user_id/role fields. The handler writes them and the schema preserves them; no fixture-only capability is assumed. The account-scoped wrapper retains one matching viewer role. Owner/admin and a successful non-fetching read are required; preparation rechecks workspace/account/role. No wire changes."
    },
